+    "find": "<p data-narration-id=\"n19\">Precision with instruments earns quietly: fretless bass guitar in <em>I Know You Know</em> but double bass in <em>Little Fly</em> and <em>I Adore You</em>; ganza and caixa, not just &lsquo;shakers and drums&rsquo;; a string trio plus double bass, not a string quartet. Examiners read vague instrument lists as guesswork &mdash; the named sonority is the difference between one mark and two.</p>",
+    "replace": "<p data-narration-id=\"n19\">Precision with instruments matters: fretless bass guitar in <em>I Know You Know</em> but double bass in <em>Little Fly</em> and <em>I Adore You</em>; ganza and caixa, not just &lsquo;shakers and drums&rsquo;; a string trio plus double bass, not a string quartet. Use specific instrument names where you can hear them rather than a vague list.</p>",
