+    "field": "practice_questions",
+    "path": "[4].marks",
+    "expect": "Any two of:\n• Scat/vocalise throughout — the voice works as an instrument with almost no conventional lyrics.\n• The melodic hook built on the speech rhythm of 'I adore you'.\n• Vocal harmony in thirds when the introduction melody repeats; improvised vocal passages in the solo section.\n• At letter P the melody climbs progressively higher with a crescendo.",
+    "value": "Accept: scat or vocalise throughout; the melodic hook based on the speech rhythm of ‘I adore you’; vocal harmony in thirds when the introduction melody repeats; improvised vocal passages in the solo section; or the melody climbing at letter P with a crescendo.",
